Subject: [PATCH 07390/11362] [outer-loop] REQ-ARC-FCP-5756:
 InertClickSigPruner 11-game live A/B + cache hygiene

Matched-budget 11-game A/B (budget=200, no-LLM) of the live-wired-but-gated-off
InertClickSigPruner, extending exp5595/exp5602's single-game (m0r0, budget~37)
never-fired nulls. At budget=200 the pruner FIRES (2643 candidates pruned, all
on sk48) and holds banked levels with NO missed win (trust+specificity+sacred
gate held), but states_expanded INCREASED (931->953, +22) rather than decreased
-- no efficiency benefit, opposite of HazardMovePruner's tu93 win. Recommend the
live default stay OFF (operator-only). adversarial_verify 0 flags.

Also routes InertClickSigPruner's connected_color_blobs calls through the shared
_cached_blobs_and_counts cache (behavior-preserving, verified identical
signatures) -- NOT exp5740's per-candidate flood (the pruner already decomposes
once per frame), a cache-sharing hygiene fix.

